  "content": {
    "_uid": "566a617e-7a00-8372-4b79-a41a5f6e0b3d",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "09897441-ef91-28ea-e817-55029cc5fcf4",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The aim of the LPTG is to build an evidence base to inform the development of an effective language policy for AKU. The focus of the meeting in Tanzania was to consider the literature review emanating from the first meeting in Karachi in October 2016 and to agree on the additional research needed to develop the evidence base. The final meeting of the LPTG will take place in London in June 2017. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
