              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n      ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "From right to left: Dr Yasmine El Masri (LPTG Research Coordinator, OUCEA, University of Oxford), Daniel Raynor (eLearning Specialist, ELE_net, AKU), Dr Tashmin Khamis (Director of QAI_net and T&L_net, AKU), Carol Ariano (Vice President Human Resources, AKU), Dr David Arthur (Dean of School of Nursing and Midwifery, AKU), Professor Pauline Rea-Dickins (Chair of LPTG, OUCEA, University of Oxford), Elizabeth Shepherd (Senior Researcher, British Council), Roger Smith (Director, ELE_net, AKU), Dr Ahmar Mahboob (Associate Professor, University of Sydney), Dr David Taylor (Director of ISMC, AKU), Louis Ariano (Associate Vice-Provost and University Registrar, AKU)",
