    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The second meeting of the Aga Khan Language Policy Thinking Group (LPTG) took place at Salama House, AKU, Dar es Salaam on 19th and 20th January 2017. The ELE_net Director, Roger Smith, is Vice-Chair of this group, and Dan Raynor (ELE_net eLearning Specialist) attended as an observer.",
